From 328b51bd0178568c1f990d30a1c2a421fff9f814 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:00:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD clean-review feature completion confirmation

Clean review results ask the patch agent for an explicit yes/no completion decision. The controller keeps repeated confirmation prompts visible, terminal yes closes the active patch-agent chat, and no or unclear answers reopen the feature for more work.
